  "Proof:",
  "  - Repository — CryptoJym/ofone-skillchain. Method: GitHub API read, public repo. MIT licensed. Version badge 0.7.0. Last push 2026-08-01. Captured 2026-08-11. Where: https://github.com/CryptoJym/ofone-skillchain",
