  "  - Live product front — of1.ai. Method: HTTP GET following redirects, returned 200. Captured 2026-08-11. Where: https://of1.ai",
  "Home proof slot: 52 of 90 predeclared benchmark slots run. Method: Counted from batch 01. The repo states in writing that the included interactive benchmark is a smoke test and establishes nothing. State: active",
  "Live links checked:",
  "  - https://cryptojym.github.io/ofone-skillchain/ returned 200 on 2026-08-11",
