  "### Teaching and people",
  "Source: https://www.jamesbrady.org/work",
  "- Free guides: a 50-technique prompt library (live; 2023-03-07 to 2024-07-24): Free guides on LinkedIn: 50 problem-solving techniques with prompts, and recipes for small businesses that pair GPT with Zapier and advise a human review. What it did: A free library of 50 problem-solving techniques with prompts.",
